# Fork of YahboomTechnology/Motor-with-Encoder: nothing goes through Git LFS here. The PDFs and images are Yahboom's
# plain git blobs and must stay that way, so this fork keeps sharing history with upstream (see AGENTS.md).
# A later line wins per attribute, so this line switches the LFS patterns above off while the block stays as it is.
* !filter !diff !merge
